I was walking slowly along that beautiful path.
Suddenly, I heard some commotion ahead.
I stopped right there to see what happened.
Some tourists were standing there.
One tourist was looking at his phone.
He was not paying attention to his surroundings at all.
Just then, a mischievous monkey jumped down from a tree.
The monkey quickly snatched his hat!
That man shouted loudly in surprise.
"Hey!"
"My hat!" he said.
But the monkey immediately climbed up the tree.
It sat on a branch taking his hat.
That tourist was just looking at his own hat.
He could not do anything.
Seeing this, I became very careful.
I immediately checked my own bag.
I held my backpack tightly with both hands.
I did not want to give my own things to the monkey.
Then I quietly went ahead from there.
